abstract: "This repository provides an empirical, multi-modal digital forensic investigation and econometric event study deconstructing viral claims surrounding NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang between October and November 2026. The research examines the distortion of a verbal protest at GTC Berlin into a physical attack hoax (refuted in 0/300 mainstream news articles), a hijacked YouTube live deepfake cryptocurrency scam, a 20-year SEC EDGAR historical governance audit (2006-2026), and a 5-stage patient-zero chronology with 11 OSINT public artifacts verified under ISO/IEC 27037:2012 chain of custody."

